  <p class="note-line">
    Figures were checked in October 2026 through PIB releases and an India Briefing summary. Counts of approved units differ between sources and dates, so confirm on the official India Semiconductor Mission and PIB pages before quoting a number.
  </p>

  <div class="honest-take">
    <p class="honest-take__label">Two stages of competition</p>
    <p>
      In chip design the first filter is a narrow entry door with strong demand for tool skills.
      The second is a separate climb later, where senior roles in verification or physical design go to people with a record of finished chips.
      Clearing the first does not clear the second, so keep a firmware or scripting skill that sells outside chip design.
    </p>
  </div>

  <h2 id="routes">Routes ranked by how far they scale</h2>

  <p>
    A route that lets you set your price and serve many customers has more headroom than a fixed ladder. Crowded or capped options stay on the list with their risk.
  </p>

