    A non-CS engineer weighing the wider map can start with <a href="/blog/career-options/career-options-for-non-cs-engineers/">career options for non-CS engineers</a>.
  </p>

  <h2 id="pay">Pay: what the sources say and do not say</h2>

  <p>
    We found no official or survey-based pay table for embedded roles. The public figures come from commercial sites, and they disagree.
    Use the spread to understand the range, not to set an expectation.
  </p>

