    </div>
  </div>

  <p>
    Use <strong>The 4-Checkpoint Protocol</strong> on your own situation. Biology: do you stay patient during long debugging? Context: can you move to Bengaluru, Hyderabad, Pune or Chennai, which one salary guide names as the main hiring cities, and can your family fund a small kit?
    Market: do live openings for your lane list freshers or only experienced people? Survival: which part of the work still needs your judgement when an assistant writes the first draft?
  </p>

  <p>
    If you are choosing between lanes with marks, budget and city in the mix, structured
    <a href="/services/career-counselling-and-career-guidance/career-guidance-after-b-tech-ece/">career guidance after B.Tech ECE</a>
    helps you make the decisions that unlock high income opportunities, one step at a time. Related reading: the
