    <a href="/blog/career-options/is-it-a-good-career-in-india/">is IT a good career</a> and the
    <a href="/blog/career-options/is-mechanical-engineering-a-good-career-in-india/">mechanical engineering verdict</a> for robotics and EV overlap.
  </p>

